<html>
<head>
<title>Consultation Letter Template</title>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
<style type="text/css">
body {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 1em;
}
</style>
<style type="text/css" media="print">
* { color: #000000; }
.DoNotPrint { display: none; }
@page { margin: 2cm; }
</style>
</head>
<body contenteditable onLoad="document.designMode = 'on';">
##letterhead##
<p>##today##</p>
##_ReferringBlock##
<p><b>Re:</b> ##label##</p>
<p>Dear Doctor,</p>
<p>Thank you for asking me to see ##first_last_name##, a ##ageGender##.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><b>History</b><br></p>
<p><b>Examination</b><br></p>
<p><b>Impression</b><br></p>
<p><b>Plan</b><br></p>
##_ClosingSalutation##
</body>
</html>
